## 🔍 DETAILED FINDINGS

### Unified Pipeline Architecture

```
API Request
    ↓
POST /api/v1/integrations/{provider}/ingest
    ↓
Creates ingestion_jobs record
    ↓
unified_ingest_task.delay(connector_type, item_ids, ...)
    ↓
┌──────────────────────────────────────┐
│ Fan-Out Pattern (Celery Group/Chord)│
├──────────────────────────────────────┤
│ Get Connector (dynamic)              │
│ Fetch Files                          │
│ Create file_status records           │
│ ↓                                    │
│ process_file_task (parallel)         │
│   - File 1 → Worker A                │
│   - File 2 → Worker B                │
│   - File 3 → Worker C                │
│ ↓                                    │
│ finalize_job_task (callback)         │
└──────────────────────────────────────┘
    ↓
Frontend subscribes to:
  - ingestion_jobs (overall status)
  - ingestion_file_status (per-file progress)
```

**All connectors flow through this exact pipeline.**

